This project is an independent community plugin for DeepSeek Harness.
It is not affiliated with DeepSeek or OpenAI.

Host transport, completed-turn single-flight, and client lifetime design are
derived from Tieboyh/dsh-next-step (MIT), commit
4bbdcef6332cdf685cc0decd4ea29177b40348fb (version 0.5.2):
https://github.com/Tieboyh/dsh-next-step
Copyright (c) 2026 Tieboyh. Original MIT terms are retained in LICENSE.

Context selection, prediction prompt and output guards, settings, client state
controller, and revision-guarded editor integration were rewritten for this fork.
The prompt optimizer from the upstream project is not included.

Other repositories were inspected for comparison; no code from those projects
is included. Host communication and editor contracts follow the published
DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.2 package interfaces.
